==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[field]] [[goal]]}}

# {{label|en|American football}} When the ball is kicked through the uprights and over the crossbar (not after a [[touchdown]]) for 3 points.
#: ''He kicked a 33 yard '''field goal''' just before the half.''
# {{label|en|basketball}} A made shot that was not a [[free throw]].
#: ''He got six '''field goals''' in the first half, two from three-point land.''

